==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1 & 2'''===
Kill off the One Horn and Le'boin with [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] and other cats with good range.

You can also rush this stage with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]]s before the One Horn spawns.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
This stage isn't too bad, just a combination of [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] for Le'boin, and midrangers like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] to deal with Cyberhorn as well as the peons.

